<title>USA: ACCOUNT CLOSED -- Fort Zumwalt, Mo., school bonds.</title>
<headline>ACCOUNT CLOSED -- Fort Zumwalt, Mo., school bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Boatman's National Bank said Thursday the account is closed and all bonds have been sold on Fort Zumwalt School District, Mo.'s $5 million general obligation bond deal.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
